%%{init: {'theme': 'default', 'themeVariables': {'fontSize': '22px', 'fontFamily': 'arial'}}}%%
flowchart TD
    A([PDF Page]) --> B[Extract Signals\nimage count · vector path count\ntext length · table count]

    B --> C{text < 10 chars\nno images\nvector paths < 5?}
    C -->|Yes| D([EMPTY · 0.90])

    C -->|No| E{has formulas AND\ntext < 50 chars?}
    E -->|Yes| F([FORMULA · 0.85])

    E -->|No| G{has images AND\nimage count > 3?}
    G -->|Yes| H([IMAGE · 0.90])

    G -->|No| I{table\ndetected?}
    I -->|Yes| J([TABLE · 0.85])

    I -->|No| K{has images\nOR formulas?}
    K -->|Yes| L([MIXED · 0.75])

    K -->|No| M{text ≥ 50 chars?}
    M -->|Yes| N([TEXT · 0.95])
    M -->|No| O([MIXED · 0.50])

    N -->|reroute: extracted markdown\ncontains image links?| P([MIXED · 0.75])

    L --> Q{vision response\ntoo short vs.\npre-extracted text?}
    O --> Q
    P --> Q
    Q -->|Yes| R([fallback:\npymupdf4llm text])
    Q -->|No| S([use vision output])

    style D fill:#f8d7da,stroke:#dc3545
    style F fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#f0ad4e
    style H fill:#cce5ff,stroke:#004085
    style J fill:#d1ecf1,stroke:#0c5460
    style L fill:#e2d9f3,stroke:#6f42c1
    style N fill:#d4edda,stroke:#28a745
    style O fill:#e2d9f3,stroke:#6f42c1
    style P fill:#e2d9f3,stroke:#6f42c1
    style R fill:#d4edda,stroke:#28a745
    style S fill:#e2d9f3,stroke:#6f42c1
